      "alt": "A short visual summary of Career Options After 12th PCM.",
      "caption": "Key points at a glance.",
      "heading": "Almost All of It Is Engineering",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 6,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "summary",
            "heading": "Key ideas from this article",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "It is \"does this door read my result, and for how long\"."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "IISER takes IAT only, and IISc BS takes JEE Advanced or IAT."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:4",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "How Long Your JEE Result Stays Useful",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A JEE result is not a permanent pass."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "JoSAA 2026 was expected to finish around 20 July 2026."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The counselling date comes from a coaching site."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "life",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:5",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "JEE But Still Give You a B.tech",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The Navy and Army cadet entries use a JEE Main result, so they show up in every \"after JEE\" list."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "You enter as a naval cadet through JEE Main rank and SSB."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Best for: students who want the uniform more than the B.Tech label."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "service",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:9",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Student Are You Right Now",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The same ledger gives three different plans, depending on what you hold today."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Your 2026 JEE Main or Advanced result opened its doors in the 2026 cycle."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Best for: a drop year spent on one new test, plus one proof asset."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "situations",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 9
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:10",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Four Questions Before You Pick a Door",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Before you commit, check your fit, your situation, the job market and AI-proofing."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Can you hold a pencil and a design for hours, wait years on a research ladder, run to a whistle, or live months at sea."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A rank you are proud of does not decide your daily work."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "checkpoint",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 10
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:11",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Headroom, and What Caps the Rest",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Several doors here have two hard filters: getting in, then the first strong placement, licence or rank."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "UCEED, NID, a CUET BSc and the IIT Madras BS all lead to work you can show before you graduate: a portfolio, a dataset, a shipped tool."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Best for: students who will build visible work every week."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "ceilings",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 11
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:13",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Proof Shelf and Multiplier Skill",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A high-value skill portfolio is one core skill, one multiplier skill and finished proof that someone else can check."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Architecture and planning"
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "What JEE prep already gave you: The Maths and Physics you drilled for JEE."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "proof",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 13
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "summary",
      "title": "Almost All of It Is Engineering"
    },
